# The hero's head close up and from behind (reports/content/2026-11-hero-head/engine-plan.md, step 0): the baseline
# of the original HUM_HEAD_PONY with face V18, and later the same clips of the new head, judged side by side.
# Xardas in the default save: the hero in front of him, the camera at the hero's face - still (blinks),
# the moods of the AI lines, a voiced dialog line of the hero's; then the market, the hero runs from behind.
#   TEMPEST_WINDOW_SIZE=1920x1080 BENCH_HOST=ryzen scripts/bench.sh scripts/bench/hero-head.bench
seed 73013
cheat god
set time 12 0
view clean 30
watch nearest
freeze nearest
wait 500
place 110 0
wait 800
watch player
cam face 38 0 1
wait 800
rec quiet
wait 8000
stop
faceanim player S_FRIENDLY 1500
rec friendly
wait 1800
faceanim player S_ANGRY 1500
rec angry
wait 1800
faceanim player S_HOSTILE 1500
rec hostile
wait 1800
faceanim player S_FRIGHTENED 1500
rec frightened
wait 1800
faceanim player T_HURT 1500
rec hurt
wait 1800
stop
watch nearest
dialog nearest
wait 300
watch player
cam face 38 20 1
rec speak
wait 1500
choose 1
wait 9000
stop
goto NW_CITY_MERCHANT_TRADE_04
watch player
walkmode run
cam look 150
cam follow 340 170 180
wait 3000
rec behind
walkto NW_CITY_MERCHANT_PATH_09
wait 6000
stop
